WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
You just need to admit the death of our third prince now

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,200
It was caused by you Omae

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,000
Then not only will we let you go

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Will also agree to let you join the great Luo Yun tribe

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:09,800
What do you think

6
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,200
You are the rebels of the Luo Yun tribe.

7
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:25,540
The third prince was originally going to be a thorn in the tower.

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:27,560
What they want is an excuse

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,820
If I let go, I would be betraying my country.

10
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,880
So what if I know

11
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:34,580
Anyway, give your answer quickly

12
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:36,380
Give me a chess piece

13
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,380
Hang him up and expose him to the sun

14
00:00:38,580 --> 00:01:05,180
Sorry, Erqi

15
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:09,610
They say that when people are about to die, they will have hallucinations before their eyes.

16
00:01:09,610 --> 00:01:11,410
It looks real
